                  "text": "Yabo 18.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lobo bidoko tim aroo, doŋ i gaŋi me Juda ki i dye gudo me Jerucalem abijuko woo me yomcwiny ma dano gitye kwede, kadi wa dwan lanyom ki dwan nyako ger bene.",
          "type": "text",
